a generated by an application or website and saved by your web browser and mobile device. It is used to identify your browser, provide analytics, and remember information about you such as your language preferences or login information."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"3.1.3",keyword:"Company: ",body:"when this policy mentions \u201cCompany\u201d, \u201cwe\u201d, \u201cus\u201d, or \u201cour\u201d, it refers to Retriever Tech Corp., Block 10 Lot 14 Victoria Village, Matina Aplaya, Davao City that is responsible for your information under this Privacy Policy."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"3.1.4",keyword:"Country: ",body:"where Retriever or the owners/founders of Retriever are based, in this case, the Philippines."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"3.1.5",keyword:"Customer: ",body:"refers to the company, organization, or person that signs up to use the Retriever Service to manage the relationships with your consumers or service users."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"3.1.6",keyword:"Device: ",body:"any internet-connected device such as a phone, tablet, computer, or any other device that can be used to visit Retriever and use the services."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"3.1.7",keyword:"Delivery: refers to the transportation and/or logistics of goods be it food, beverages, groceries or other products via the use of Retriever."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"3.1.8",keyword:"IP address: ",body:"Every device connected to the Internet is assigned a number known as an Internet protocol (IP) address. These numbers are usually assigned in geographic blocks. An IP address can often be used to identify the location from which a device is connecting to the Internet."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"3.1.9",keyword:"Merchant Partner: refers to third party individuals or organizations partnered with Retriever who provide the relevant goods to the consumer via our Platform."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"3.1.10",keyword:"Order: the act of using the Retriever App to buy the goods or other products from the in app store of the Merchant Partner and have it delivered to a chosen location."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"3.1.11",keyword:"Personnel: ",body:"refers to those individuals who are employed by Retriever or are under contract to perform a service on behalf of one of the parties."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"3.1.12",keyword:"Personal Data: ",body:"Any information that directly, indirectly, or in connection with other information - including a personal identification number - allows for the identification or identifiability of a natural person."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"3.1.13",keyword:"Platform: refers to the Application, Software and any other platform, portal or website which Retriever owns, operates or otherwise makes available to Consumers and/or Partners for the purposes of or in connection with the Service and/or Solution."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"3.1.14",keyword:"Service: ",body:"refers to the service provided by Retriever as described in the relative terms (if available) and on this platform."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"3.1.15",keyword:"Retriever Wallet: refers to the in-app currency of Retriever which you can use to pay for the services in the app."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"3.1.16",keyword:"Third-party service: ",body:"refers to advertisers, contest sponsors, promotional and marketing partners, and others who provide our content or whose products or services we think may interest you."}),(0,b.jsxs)(o.View,{style:f.bodyWrapper1,children:[(0,b.jsx)(o.Text,{style:f.sectionNumber,children:"3.1.17."}),(0,b.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:f.body,children:[(0,b.jsx)(o.Text,{style:{fontStyle:'italic'},children:"Website: "}),"Retriever\u2019s site, which can be accessed via this URL:",' ',(0,b.jsx)(o.Text,{style:{color:'blue',textDecorationLine:'underline'},onPress:function(){return o.Linking.openURL("http://www.retriever.ph/")},chil