applicable, Orders will include delivery fees and any applicable tax (e.g. good and service tax, value-added tax, etc.)"}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.3.",body:"Special Instructions - Retriever and the Merchant Partner (as the case may be) reasonably endeavor to comply with your special instructions for an Order. However in some cases where this is not feasible, possible, or commercially reasonable, Retriever and/or the Merchant Partner reserve the right to proceed to prepare the Order in accordance with standard operating procedures. Neither Retriever nor the Merchant Partner shall be responsible to replace or refund an Order which does not conform to special instructions provided by you."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.4.",body:"Allergens - Retriever is not obliged to provide ingredient information or allergen information on the Platforms. Further, Retriever does not guarantee that the Goods sold by the Merchant Partner are free of allergens. If you have allergies, allergic reactions, or dietary restrictions and requirements, please contact the Merchant Partner before placing an Order on our Platform."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.5.",body:"Please note that your order may be subject to additional terms and conditions provided by the Merchant Partner."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.6.",body:"Prior to placing the order"}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.6.1",body:"You are required to provide the delivery address in order for the Platform to display the Merchant Partner available in your delivery area.",keyword:!0}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.6.2",body:"Once you select a Merchant Partner, you will be taken to that Merchant Partner\u2019s menu page for you to select and add your Goods to the cart.",keyword:!0}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.7.",body:"Placing the Order"}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.7.1",body:"To complete an order, please follow the onscreen instructions after clicking \u201cCart\u201d. You may be required to provide additional details for us to complete your order. You are required to review and confirm that all the information and promo codes (if applicable) are true, accurate, and complete before you click \u201cPLACE ORDER\u201d. An Order is successfully placed when you received confirmation from the Merchant Partner and an email confirmation containing your Order receipt from us.",keyword:!0}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.8.",body:"All Orders and delivery bookings placed on the application are treated as confirmed. You shall not be entitled to cancel your Order once you have received a confirmation."}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.9.",body:"You remain liable to pay the order value in full where:"}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.9.1.",body:"You are not present or do not show up at the designated delivery location after ten (10) minutes from the time that the Rider arrives at the designated delivery location or",keyword:!0}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.9.2.",body:"You are unreachable physically or uncountable after ten (10) minutes from the time that the Rider arrives at the designated location",keyword:!0}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.10.",body:"Retriever, the Merchant Partner and/or Rider may not process your booking for Order in the event of any of the following:"}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.10.1.",body:"You are unavailable on the mobile device at the time of the call for confirming the order or otherwise uncontactable,",keyword:!0}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.10.2.",body:"If the requested delivery location falls outside the delivery zone offered in the Application,",keyword:!0}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.10.3.",body:"There is a lack of information, direction, or authorization from you at the time of the delivery,",keyword:!0}),(0,b.jsx)(h.default,{sectionNumber:"5.10.4",body:"You are not present or do not show up at the designated delivery location to c